$DIR/test.p:5:1: label L already declared
    This error occurs when a label is declared more than once.
    (see "Label scopes" in the Plutonium spec, section 10.1)
    (run "pluto explain E0120" for a longer explanation)

$DIR/test.p:4:1: 	other declaration of L
    (explained above; run "pluto explain E0120" for more)

$DIR/test.p:4:1: label L declared and not used
    A label is declared but no break, continue or goto uses it. Remove it.
    (see "Labeled statements" in the Plutonium spec, section 12.3)
    (run "pluto explain E0122" for a longer explanation)
